OL,3,GNEWSAVisitors willing to 'take their
OL,4,Achances' with parking fines
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople wanting to park near a Lake
OL,7,FDistrict beauty spot are willing to
OL,8,Fbreach parking restrictions and "take
OL,9,Ftheir chances" on being fined rather
OL,10,Fpay for parking further away, local
OL,11,Fresidents say.
OL,13,FCumberland Council issued more than
OL,14,F25,000 penalty charge notices (PCNs)
OL,15,Ffor parking contraventions in the past
OL,16,Ffinancial year, with the top five
OL,17,Flocations all in the Keswick area.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
