OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1792684585
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAVisitors willing to 'take their
OL,4,Achances' with parking fines
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe C2057 road between Portinscale and
OL,7,FGrange had the highest number, with
OL,8,F1,081 drivers fined. Parking has
OL,9,Fhistorically been an issue there
OL,10,Fbecause of its proximity to Catbells, a
OL,11,Fpopular hill for walkers.
OL,13,FProposals last year for a car park and
OL,14,Fpark-and-ride service at Portinscale
OL,15,Fwere rejected by the planning
OL,16,Fauthority.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
